  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'i wish i could stand by you!' which implies a personal, first-person desire. The text directly addresses the viewer as the one who is 'wishing' — creating an implicit 'you' that the user identifies with. The user is thus projected onto the textual material as the speaker of the wish, making the text the focal point of the user's identification with the meme's message.",
